      "message": "Accept the complete 327-variable consistency quartic\n\nMaterialize both integer charts of the fused-nine source. The centered equation has 327 variables, 216 residuals, 5718 quartic terms and height 128446: two fewer variables and ten fewer terms than the 329 form at unchanged degree and heights. Publish all coefficients, actual monic/free maps, Horn overwrites, translations and complete endpoint calibration.\n\nAll five author commands and four fresh root checks/rebuilds pass. Both independent collectors reject 54 actual corruptions and recollect all seven complete baseline charts. Every full root JSON/stdout record matches the author. Authenticate 549 external pins and 21 exact sealed inventories, and independently account for the entire retention difference. Close immutable author/root verification packets and update the current comparison. Preserve all predecessors, canonical PDF/TeX and paused Lean work.",
