      "message": "Place 7 wave-14 Con(ZFC) Diophantine packages as sources 127-133\n\nBatch 230. The seven archives of arrival fd3e384e92 (24 October 2026,\n21:17, \"Con(ZFC) in Diophantine form\") are extracted straight from the\ncommitted ZIPs into\nComputability/DiophantineConsistency/con-zfc-diophantine-forms/127-...133-...,\nin archive-name order, wrappers removed. Waves 5-13 (31-126) are kept.\n\nMembers: 3,294 = 1,148 staged + 2,140 copies omitted + 6 ignored. Omitted\nmembers are byte-identical (up to line ends) to stable repository blobs,\nmostly earlier-wave files bundled under upstream/, inherited/ and intake/;\nmembers matched only by the research session's volatile copies are kept\n(the rule of c16a89ad94). Licence, notice and attribution files are always\nkept. 37 placed paths exceed 250 characters (git core.longpaths is on).\nPLACEMENT.md gains the batch-230 record with the full map.\n\nAll seven ZIPs are retired from docs/incoming; docs/incoming/README.md\nstays. Every placed file was checked against the archive bytes and every\nomission against its map target. Nothing was edited and nothing was run.\nThe reconciliation README and the catalogue follow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
